[I] A library to handle the activation process of iOS devices

[T] libideviceactivation is a library to manage the activation and
[T] deactivation of Apple iOS devices by talking to Apple's activation
[T] webservice. It supports the legacy and current webservice APIs and
[T] includes the ideviceactivation command line utility.

